  {
    "version": "0.1",
    "section": 2,
    "moments": [
      {
        "narration": "在单位圆中，动点 P 的横坐标代表余弦值 cos θ。当我们旋转动点，注意看它在 x 轴上的投影长度变化。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "intent": "观察动点P在x轴上的投影与余弦值的对应关系",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 1,
                "item": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "action": "point_at",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "reference": {
              "source": "reusable",
              "section": 1,
              "item": 1
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "当 θ = 0 时，投影在最右侧，横坐标达到最大值 1。",
        "delivery": "neutral",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "animate",
            "timing": "before_speech",
            "number": 1,
            "end_value": 0,
            "duration_intent": "brief",
            "easing": "linear"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "随着逆时针旋转，在 θ = π/2 时，投影回到原点，横坐标降为 0。",
        "delivery": "neutral",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "animate",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "number": 1,
            "end_value": 1.57,
            "duration_intent": "normal",
            "easing": "linear"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "继续旋转至 θ = π 时，投影到达最左侧，横坐标达到最低值 -1。将这一过程在平面直角坐标系中展开，就得到了余弦曲线 y = cos θ。",
        "delivery": "emphatic",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "animate",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "number": 1,
            "end_value": 3.14,
            "duration_intent": "extended",
            "easing": "linear"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "version": "0.1",
    "section": 3,
    "moments": [
      {
        "narration": "大家请看单位圆，动点 P 在圆周上运动，其在 x 轴上的投影坐标正好对应着 cos θ 的数值。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "intent": "引导观察动点P在x轴上的投影位置",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 1,
                "item": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "现在我们将余弦曲线 y 等于 cos x 与正弦曲线 y 等于 sin x 绘制在同一个坐标系中进行对比。",
        "delivery": "neutral",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "visual",
            "timing": "before_speech",
            "content": {
              "capability": "function_plot",
              "parameters": {
                "title": "正弦与余弦曲线对比",
                "curve_labels": [
                  "y = cos x",
                  "y = sin x"
                ],
                "expressions": [
                  "cos(x)",
                  "sin(x)"
                ]
              }
            },
            "role": "comparison_visual",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "right_of",
              "reference": {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 1,
                "item": 1
              }
            },
            "reusable_item": 1,
            "distinct_visual": true
          },
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "y = \\cos x, \\quad y = \\sin x"
            },
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 2,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "对比两条曲线可以发现，它们的波形形状完全相同。余弦曲线的波峰在 x 等于 0 时出现，比正弦曲线提前了二分之派个单位。几何上，这相当于将正弦图像整体向左平移了二分之派个单位。",
        "delivery": "emphatic",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "point_at",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "reference": {
              "source": "local_board_item",
              "moment": 2,
              "item": 1
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "animate",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "number": 1,
            "end_value": 1.57,
            "duration_intent": "extended",
            "easing": "linear"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "由此可知，余弦函数与正弦函数满足关系式 cos θ 等于 sin(θ 加二分之派)。这就是著名的诱导公式。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "after_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "\\cos\\theta = \\sin\\left(\\theta + \\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)"
            },
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 2,
                "item": 2
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "请你试着拖动滑块，观察旋转角度 θ 在不同区间内余弦值的波峰与零点变化情况。",
        "delivery": "encouraging",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 4,
                "item": 1
              }
            ],
            "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
            "timing": "after_speech"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "student_activities": [
